{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20499","headline":"罔象得玄珠 · 张籍","name":"罔象得玄珠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"赤水今何处，遗珠已渺然。\n离娄徒肆目，罔象乃通玄。\n皎洁因成性，圆明不在泉。\n暗中看夜色，尘外照晴田。\n无胫真难掬，怀疑实易迁。\n今朝搜择得，应免媚晴川。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20499.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20499","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}